#: manifest.json
msgid ""
"A YouTube sidebar for Vestra Player: search, see thumbnails, titles, durations and channels, and play a video with a double-click. Download videos as MKV files, or play and download a single video from its link. No sign-in and nothing to install: the YouTube part uses the bundled open-source library youtubei.js, downloads use the player's own ffmpeg.\n"
"→ Sidebar: VestraTube tab; Menu: Open ▸ VestraTube"
